OL,3,GNEWSAFlu hospital admissions surge     
OL,4,Aacross the South                       
OL,6,FFlu hospital admissions have surged    
OL,7,Facross the south of England, new       
OL,8,Ffigures show.                          
OL,10,FThe rate of admissions in the South    
OL,11,FEast has almost tripled in a week,     
OL,12,Fwhile the South West has seen a rise of
OL,13,Fabout a quarter, according to the UK   
OL,14,FHealth Security Agency (UKHSA).        
OL,16,FAcross England, admissions rose by     
OL,17,Falmost 80%. Dr Suzanna McDonald, from  
OL,18,FUKHSA, said: "A lot of people think    
OL,19,Fit's not serious. It absolutely is."   
