OL,3,GNEWSAFlu hospital admissions surge     
OL,4,Aacross the South                       
OL,6,FSome hospitals are encouraging people  
OL,7,Fto wear masks in certain areas,        
OL,8,Fincluding Queen Alexandra Hospital in  
OL,9,FPortsmouth and Wexham Park Hospital in 
OL,10,FSlough.                                
